### Health & system endpoints
### Routes: GET /api/health, GET /api/config
### Both are public (never require auth, even when SCHIST_AUTH_ENABLED=true).

### Health check — verify the API is running
# @name health
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
# => 200 { "status": "ok", "service": "schist" }

### Health check with a CORS origin (development)
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
Origin: {{frontendUrl}}

### Runtime config — tells the frontend whether auth is enabled
# @name config
GET {{apiUrl}}/config
# => 200 { "auth_enabled": false }

### CORS preflight — what a browser sends before a cross-origin POST
OPTIONS {{apiUrl}}/documents
Origin: {{frontendUrl}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type
